  "project_description": "Provides capability to generate dynamic QR Codes based on their current active page URL. \n\n Features \n \n Generate dynamic QR Codes using current page URL. \n Share the QR code link directly over Email, Messages, and some social media platforms. \n Admin screen is also available for content authors to generate QR code and download for custom URLs. \n User can place the QR code block in several display format : QR will be shown as it is, QR as floating icons. \n QR code for each individual can be downloaded for future references or any promotional uses. \n \n Recommended modules/libraries \n This project is strictly dependent of php chillerlan library ( https://github.com/chillerlan/php-qrcode ). In order to make this module functional make sure that chillerlan library is successfully downloaded and available in your site.\n\n Back to top",
